# NexDesk Standards

## Tech Stack

- React
- Vite
- Node
- Express
- MongoDB
- Material UI

## Coding Standards

- Use functional components
- Use hooks
- Use async await
- Use service layer
- Use repository pattern
- Use reusable components
- Use JWT Authentication
- Use tenantId filtering

## Change Scope

- Never regenerate existing code.
- Only modify requested files.
